This project fine-tunes ModernBERT (answerdotai/ModernBERT-base and
answerdotai/ModernBERT-large, Apache-2.0) on the choice tasks of
Praveenrajus/jev-bench. No dataset content is redistributed here; the
per-source licenses of the benchmark are recorded in data_audit.json for
every run and include CC-BY-SA-4.0 terms for ARC-Challenge and ChaosNLI.
